	(text "SYSTEM NOTES\n- RMT TX carrier is runtime-selectable from 25 kHz to 50 kHz.\n- The discrete AFE rejects DC sunlight; the Schmitt stage restores logic.\n- RMT RX carrier removal yields blockage intervals for the adaptive LUT.\n- J3/J4 are the harness boundary; J4/R1/D1 are on the remote PCB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
